<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Samuel Adebayo — Analytics Engineer</title>
<meta name="description" content="Samuel Adebayo builds data platforms — ingestion, modelling and the reporting layer on top. Lagos, Nigeria.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400;0,9..144,600;1,9..144,400&family=Karla:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --base:#101520;
    --raise:#161C2A;
    --rule:#242D3E;
    --ink:#E9E6DF;
    --mute:#8E99AE;
    --brass:#DFA340;
    --brass-dim:#8A6526;
    --display:'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;
    --body:'Karla',system-ui,sans-serif;
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}

  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--base);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:var(--body);
    font-size:17px;
    line-height:1.65;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }

  a{color:inherit;}

  ::selection{background:var(--brass);color:var(--base);}

  :focus-visible{
    outline:2px solid var(--brass);
    outline-offset:3px;
  }

  .shell{
    max-width:1240px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:0 40px;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:minmax(0,42%) minmax(0,58%);
    gap:72px;
  }

  /* ---------- left rail ---------- */

  .rail{
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
    height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    justify-content:center;
    padding:80px 0;
  }

  .portrait{
    width:128px;
    height:171px;
    object-fit:cover;
    border-radius:3px;
    margin-bottom:30px;
    border:1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .name{
    font-family:var(--display);
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:clamp(2.6rem,4.6vw,3.6rem);
    line-height:1.02;
    letter-spacing:-.022em;
    margin:0 0 14px;
  }

  .role{
    font-size:1.06rem;
    color:var(--ink);
    margin:0 0 18px;
    font-weight:500;
  }

  .pitch{
    color:var(--mute);
    max-width:34ch;
    margin:0 0 44px;
    font-size:.97rem;
  }

  nav ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;}
  nav li{margin-bottom:2px;}

  nav a{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:14px;
    text-decoration:none;
    color:var(--mute);
    font-size:.86rem;
    letter-spacing:.12em;
    padding:7px 0;
    transition:color .18s ease;
  }
  nav a::before{
    content:"";
    width:26px;
    height:1px;
    background:var(--rule);
    transition:width .22s ease,background .22s ease;
  }
  nav a:hover,nav a:focus-visible{color:var(--ink);}
  nav a:hover::before,nav a:focus-visible::before{width:48px;background:var(--mute);}
  nav a.on{color:var(--brass);}
  nav a.on::before{width:56px;background:var(--brass);}

  .social{
    margin-top:44px;
    display:flex;
    gap:22px;
    font-size:.88rem;
  }
  .social a{
    color:var(--mute);
    text-decoration:none;
    border-bottom:1px solid transparent;
    padding-bottom:2px;
    transition:color .18s ease,border-color .18s ease;
  }
  .social a:hover{color:var(--brass);border-color:var(--brass-dim);}

  /* ---------- right column ---------- */

  main{padding:120px 0 140px;}

  section{margin-bottom:110px;}
  section:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}

  h2{
    font-family:var(--display);
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:1.28rem;
    letter-spacing:-.01em;
    margin:0 0 26px;
    color:var(--ink);
  }

  p{max-width:66ch;}
  .lede p{margin:0 0 20px;}
  .lede p:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}
  .lede strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700;}

  /* ---------- experience ---------- */

  .job{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;
    gap:26px;
    padding:22px 0;
    border-top:1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .job:last-of-type{border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);}
  .when{
    color:var(--mute);
    font-size:.82rem;
    letter-spacing:.04em;
    padding-top:4px;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .job h3{
    margin:0 0 6px;
    font-size:1rem;
    font-weight:700;
  }
  .job p{margin:0;color:var(--mute);font-size:.95rem;}
  .job p a{color:var(--brass);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--brass-dim);padding-bottom:1px;}
  .job p a:hover{border-color:var(--brass);}

  /* ---------- projects: lineage rail ---------- */

  .work{
    position:relative;
    padding-left:30px;
  }
  .work::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    left:4px;
    top:14px;
    bottom:14px;
    width:1px;
    background:var(--rule);
  }

  .entry{
    position:relative;
    display:block;
    text-decoration:none;
    padding:26px 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .entry:first-child{border-top:1px solid var(--rule);}

  .entry::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    left:-30px;
    top:38px;
    width:9px;
    height:9px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--base);
    border:1px solid var(--rule);
    transition:border-color .2s ease,background .2s ease;
  }
  .entry:hover::before,.entry:focus-visible::before{
    border-color:var(--brass);
    background:var(--brass);
  }

  .entry h3{
    font-family:var(--display);
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:1.16rem;
    margin:0 0 4px;
    letter-spacing:-.008em;
    transition:color .2s ease;
  }
  .entry:hover h3,.entry:focus-visible h3{color:var(--brass);}

  .status{
    font-size:.78rem;
    color:var(--brass);
    letter-spacing:.06em;
    margin:0 0 12px;
  }

  .entry p.what{
    margin:0 0 14px;
    color:var(--mute);
    font-size:.96rem;
    max-width:58ch;
  }

  .result{
    margin:0 0 16px;
    font-size:.93rem;
    color:var(--ink);
    padding-left:14px;
    border-left:2px solid var(--brass-dim);
    max-width:54ch;
  }

  .stack{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:7px;
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    list-style:none;
  }
  .stack li{
    font-size:.74rem;
    letter-spacing:.05em;
    color:var(--mute);
    border:1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius:2px;
    padding:3px 9px;
  }

  .todo{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:14px;
    font-size:.78rem;
    color:#F0C674;
    background:rgba(223,163,64,.08);
    border:1px dashed var(--brass-dim);
    border-radius:2px;
    padding:6px 10px;
  }

  /* ---------- contact ---------- */

  .contact p{color:var(--mute);}
  .contact a.mail{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:14px;
    font-family:var(--display);
    font-size:1.24rem;
    color:var(--brass);
    text-decoration:none;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--brass-dim);
    padding-bottom:3px;
  }

  footer{
    margin-top:96px;
    padding-top:24px;
    border-top:1px solid var(--rule);
    color:var(--mute);
    font-size:.82rem;
  }

  /* ---------- entrance ---------- */

  .rail > *{opacity:0;animation:rise .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1) forwards;}
  .rail > *:nth-child(1){animation-delay:.05s;}
  .rail > *:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.11s;}
  .rail > *:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.17s;}
  .rail > *:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.23s;}
  .rail > *:nth-child(5){animation-delay:.29s;}
  .rail > *:nth-child(6){animation-delay:.35s;}
  @keyframes rise{to{opacity:1;transform:none;}}
  .rail > *{transform:translateY(10px);}

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    html{scroll-behavior:auto;}
    .rail > *{animation:none;opacity:1;transform:none;}
    *{transition-duration:.01ms !important;}
  }

  /* ---------- responsive ---------- */

  @media (max-width:900px){
    .shell{
      grid-template-columns:1fr;
      gap:0;
      padding:0 24px;
    }
    .rail{
      position:static;
      height:auto;
      padding:72px 0 8px;
    }
    .pitch{margin-bottom:28px;}
    nav{display:none;}
    .social{margin-top:28px;}
    main{padding:48px 0 90px;}
    section{margin-bottom:76px;}
    .job{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px;}
    body{font-size:16px;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="shell">

  <header class="rail">
    <img class="portrait" src="assets/sammy.jpg" width="128" height="171"
         alt="Samuel Adebayo">

    <h1 class="name">Samuel<br>Adebayo</h1>

    <p class="role">Analytics engineer</p>

    <p class="pitch">I build the pipe and the picture at the end of it — ingestion, modelling, and the reporting layer people actually open. Lagos, Nigeria.</p>

    <nav>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#about" class="on">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="#experience">Experience</a></li>
        <li><a href="#work">Selected work</a></li>
        <li><a href="#certifications">Certifications</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="social">
      <a href="https://github.com/Sammy22layo">GitHub</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/samuel-adebayo-368b6224b">LinkedIn</a>
      <a href="assets/Samuel-Adebayo-CV.pdf">CV</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>

    <section id="about" class="lede">
      <h2>About</h2>
      <p>I started out as a chemical engineer and ended up a data analyst, which
         turned out to be a shorter walk than it sounds — both are mostly about
         finding where a process leaks.</p>
      <p>Today I work in insurance at <strong>Tangerine General</strong> in Lagos,
         where I build the reporting layer the business runs on: dashboards for
         production, retail and claims, and the Python and Power Automate jobs
         that keep them fed without anyone touching a spreadsheet. I sit on the
         transformation team as its analyst, which means I spend as much time
         mapping how a process actually works as I do querying it.</p>
      <p>Outside work I build the engineering half end to end. The project below
         is a full platform — Azure Data Factory into Databricks, SCD2
         dimensions, a delivery model, and the Power BI layer on top — built,
         tested and documented, including the parts that went wrong.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="experience">
      <h2>Experience</h2>

      <div class="job">
        <div class="when">2024 — now</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Data Analyst · Tangerine General</h3>
          <p>Power BI and the semantic models behind it, SQL and Python
             automation, and the transformation team's analytics.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="job">
        <div class="when">2024</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Data Analytics Instructor · New Horizons</h3>
          <p>Taught analytics fundamentals — nine months of explaining SQL and
             Power BI to people seeing them for the first time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="work">
      <h2>Selected work</h2>

      <div class="work">

        <a class="entry" href="projects/confluence.html">
          <h3>Two marketplaces, one set of numbers</h3>
          <p class="what">A Brazilian e-commerce platform acquires a South
             African one. Finance needs one revenue figure that stops moving;
             operations need to know which platform is actually failing. An
             end-to-end platform — metadata-driven ingestion from 18 sources, a
             medallion warehouse with SCD2 merchant history, a delivery-promise
             model, and six Power BI pages served live.</p>
          <p class="result">Restating history at today's FX rate was understating
             Brazilian revenue by $392,528 — 9.7%. A blended 85% on-time rate was
             hiding one platform at 95.2% and another at 65.9%.</p>
          <ul class="stack">
            <li>Azure Data Factory</li><li>Databricks</li><li>Delta Lake</li>
            <li>Unity Catalog</li><li>PySpark</li><li>Azure SQL</li>
            <li>scikit-learn</li><li>Power BI</li>
          </ul>
        </a>

        <a class="entry" href="https://garbage-classifier-app-cynuvxdl2wjykhjwcu5fvd.streamlit.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <h3>Sorting waste from a phone camera</h3>
          <p class="what">Recycling only works if waste gets separated, and most
             people guess. An image classifier that takes a photo — uploaded or
             shot on the spot — and names the material (cardboard, glass, metal,
             paper, plastic or trash) with a confidence score. Deployed on
             Streamlit, so anyone can open it and try their own photo.</p>
          <p class="result">~75% validation accuracy across six materials on 2,527
             images — up from 64% once a scratch-built CNN that was overfitting
             gave way to transfer learning (MobileNetV2, ResNet50) with
             augmentation.</p>
          <ul class="stack">
            <li>TensorFlow</li><li>Keras</li><li>MobileNetV2</li><li>ResNet50</li><li>Streamlit</li>
          </ul>
        </a>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="certifications">
      <h2>Certifications</h2>

      <div class="job">
        <div class="when">2024</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Google Data Analytics Professional Certificate</h3>
          <p>Coursera · <a href="https://www.coursera.org/account/accomplishments/professional-cert/S85VKSW9NKVH" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Verify credential</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="job">
        <div class="when">2026</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Databricks Certified Data Engineer Associate</h3>
          <p>In progress</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="contact">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Open to remote analytics engineering roles. The fastest way to reach me
         is email.</p>
      <a class="mail" href="mailto:sammy22layo@gmail.com">sammy22layo@gmail.com</a>
      <footer>Built by hand. No template.</footer>
    </section>

  </main>
</div>

<script>
  var links = document.querySelectorAll('nav a');
  var spots = [].map.call(links, function (a) {
    return document.querySelector(a.getAttribute('href'));
  });

  function mark() {
    var y = window.scrollY + window.innerHeight * 0.35;
    var current = 0;
    spots.forEach(function (el, i) {
      if (el && el.offsetTop <= y) current = i;
    });
    links.forEach(function (a, i) {
      a.classList.toggle('on', i === current);
    });
  }

  window.addEventListener('scroll', mark, { passive: true });
  mark();
</script>

</body>
</html>
